Z||000002||mrfiero||09-08-2001||02:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>All 88s had the vented rotors and different calibers too.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They were available in .22, .38, .45.......mine's a 9mm, but I hear they're rare.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I couldn't resist.....sorry.<P>All '88s have vented rotors and different <B><I>calipers</B></I> and they won't work on early Fieros unless you do the '88 cradle swap (but then you can only use the rear brakes).||||reg||12
